 다들 핵심을 놓쳤잖아! 귀네스 님이 인기가 많은 건 바로~ “드래곤 슬레이어”이기 때문이지!","source_cn":"不对不对，你们都没说到点上，格温妮丝大人之所以受欢迎，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABC3365249D0F7BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1710225009":{"text":"아니, 아니! 다들 핵심을 놓쳤잖아! 귀네스 님이 인기가 많은 건 바로~ “드래곤 슬레이어”이기 때문이지!","source_cn":"不对不对，你们都没说到点上，格温妮丝大人之所以受欢迎，是因为她是大名鼎鼎的狩龙骑士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABC3365249D0F7BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710225010:1":{"text":"이제 막 얘기하려던 참이었거든?!","source_cn":"我刚要开始讲呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2138E77BE8CA82C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710225011:0":{"text":"예전에 국왕님께서 라이온하트 사냥터에서 사냥을 하시는데, 거대한 테라 드래곤 한 마리가 달려들었대요!","source_cn":"有一次国王陛下在狮心猎场狩猎的时候，一只大地龙突然闯进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66E24FD770D1A23C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710225012:1":{"text":"덩치는 작은 산만큼 크고, 발톱도 날카로운 데다 불까지 뿜었다잖아요!","source_cn":"那只大地龙有一座小山那么大，爪子尖利无比，还会喷火！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21386C9040E9CDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710225013:1":{"text":"그 앞에서 궁정 마법사도, 근위대도 다들 아무것도 못하고 도망치던 와중에...","source_cn":"面对这样大的怪物，那些宫廷魔法师啊，守备军啊什么的都吓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0751DAD4BC0348F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710225014:1":{"text":"그때 귀네스 님이 나섰던 거죠!","source_cn":"这时候是格温妮丝大人站了出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x650439D665EE1FA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710225015:1":{"text":"맞아요! 귀네스 님은 전혀 당황하지 않고 말에 실려 있던 거대한 드래곤 보우를 떠올리셨대요!","source_cn":"对！格温妮丝大人一点都没有慌乱，而是第一时间想到有匹战...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x943C940EB3C65442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710225016:1":{"text":"그건 세 명이 힘을 합쳐야 겨우 당길 수 있댔어요!","source_cn":"那张弓要三个人才能合力拉开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2149CF41E24A31AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710225017:1":{"text":"아냐, 다섯 명이야!","source_cn":"不对，是五个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BD681E2373A08A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710225018:0":{"text":"열 명이라던데?","source_cn":"我听说是十个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC56E806ECEA1A8B8","v